#   voice my_audio["138"]
#       nar "Your father is still lying unconscious, the meaning behind his note remains unclear, and Henry barely trusts you inside his home. None of the important questions have disappeared overnight."
    voice my_audio["138"]
    nar "Seu pai continua inconsciente, o significado do bilhete dele permanece obscuro, e Henry mal confia em você dentro de casa. Nenhuma das questões importantes desapareceu da noite para o dia."

# game/code/5 events/release 1/marnie2.rpy:557
translate brazil normalwake_9ac78d27:

#   voice my_audio["139"]
#       nar "Still, yesterday proved that you can walk into someone else's chaos without becoming part of it. Get cleaned up, clear your head, and then begin looking for the answers you came here to find."
    voice my_audio["139"]
    nar "No entanto, ontem provou que você pode entrar no caos de outra pessoa sem se tornar parte dele. Recupere o fôlego, clareie a mente e então comece a procurar as respostas que você veio buscar."

# game/code/5 events/release 1/marnie2.rpy:580
